Title: No Limit: A Bot Building Tournament
URL: https://pokerbot.sequoiacap.com/index.html
Description: No Limit is a pokerbot building tournament for university students and ’25/’26 grads, hosted by Sequoia, Citadel Securities and OpenAI. 60 minutes to build, thousands of games, $100K grand prize. Regionals in Bay Area, Boston and Pittsburgh; finals in San Francisco Nov 15.